  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: ZVARTNOTS AIRPORT EXPANSION PROJECT (PHASE 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will finance the construction of a new landside terminal building and the purchase of equipment to supplement the existing airside concourse building. It will increase the passenger- handling capacity of the Zvartnots International Airport (ZIA) to about 3.2 million a year from the current level of 1.8 million&#x2013;2.0 million a year. The project will be the first private sector infrastructure investment by the Asian Development Bank (ADB) in Armenia or the Caucasus region.</narrative>
  </description>
